[ai_tracker] Get AI tracker aggregated prompts scoreboard
GenAI Prompts Aggregated API — period-aggregated per-prompt metrics
for a Brand Visibility campaign (one row per prompt x LLM).

Use for weekly scoreboards, prompt monitoring, and competitive
prompt analysis.

