Returns a bearer token, valid for `ttlSeconds`, for calling this Space's own WordPress REST API with the access of one of its machine credentials (`credentialId`). Authenticate normally; you never need that credential's secret. Send the token only to the returned `endpoint`, and keep it out of logs and chat. The Space re-checks the credential's Grant on every request, so the returned capabilities and role are what to expect, not a promise.

