Read-only, paginated access metadata for a team on an Enterprise or Internal plan. A root team's page covers the root and its live subteams; a subteam's page covers that subteam. scope.teams lists only the teams this credential can read, and scope.complete says whether that is all of them. getTeamExternalAccessSummary reports whether permissions hide anything else. Any member of an Enterprise or Internal team can call it for a page team they can read; any other team is not found. Rows also require Space read access. Read team defaults separately with listTeamExternalAccessTeams. Space counts describe returned rows, not totals. Filter scans are bounded; continue with nextCursor even after an empty page. An owningTeamId outside scope.teams is not found. Sharing URLs, credentials, private connection identities and traffic are excluded.

```ts
